  "waitConclusion": "Consuming wait controls retain child CPU. Explicit SIGCHLD_IGN and SA_NOCLDWAIT lose over 80 ms through direct children and through actual orphan adoption by an intermediate subreaper, while the outer collector reports zero adopted children and clean observed teardown. Outer wait sums cannot repair that missing coverage.",
